      <description>&lt;p&gt;For a long time, I always used Hexo as my blogging generator. But when i switched to Hugo, the things&amp;rsquo;re completely different. The deployment methods changed .&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For now, if i wanna host my stuff on somethng like Github Pages, i should utillize so called &amp;ldquo;continuous deployment&amp;rdquo; which leverages on Github Action. I&amp;rsquo;m required to push my primitive content into remote repository, and let the remote finish the building process.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
